// Cyrus R4 worldgen: the VERSION-NEUTRAL resource kinds the build model may write into a DataPackSpec (still
// schemaVersion 1: the new kinds are additions to the resource union, so every existing v1 spec stays valid and emits
// the same bytes). World generation is confined to the mod's OWN namespace: a custom dimension (dimension +
// dimension_type) whose biome source uses only the pack's own biomes, the pack's own features in those biomes, and
// structures placed only in those biomes. Vanilla biomes / dimensions / noise are never edited (see NOT_SUPPORTED).
//
// Engine safety: there is no custom noise router or density function: terrain shape comes from a vanilla
